	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Tuas recepi scriptas prima die huius mensis... <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>cuperem, si ocium et valetudo pateretur; sed spero me brevi <lb xml:id="p1z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> profecturum.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Rex enim amplissimo senatui scribit, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>sicut faciendum existimavi; literas ipse feram.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Interim scribo <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>iterum d. consuli, ut contineat, quoad illi ęquum et rectum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>videbitur, <placeName ref="l300">Lucernates</placeName> et eos per literas oret, expectent usque <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>ad proximam dietam <placeName ref="l21">Badensem</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Nam tametsi sint omnia in <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>optimo statu et velit illis rex satisfacere, ut iudicabunt sani <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>omnes, scripserunt ad me, nisi rex det responsum et promittat <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>se velle dare decem pro centum et solvere hoc mense usuram <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>duorum annorum et iunio tertium annum cum mille et ducentis <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>coronatis pro expensis, quas nunquam declararunt, se 16. huius <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>mensis missuros suos cum iudicibus Paterniacum.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Quod si <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>fiat, alienabitur forsan iuvenis regis animus ab eo, quod constituit <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>facere, et erit hec res ridicula omnibus.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Paterniaci enim nihil <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>poterunt constituere iudices, quia prius contrarietas sententiarum, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>que nuper eos remorata est, decidi debet et conveniendum <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>de quinto arbitro; sed volo stare omnium legatorum sententie.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Hoc negocium quęso commendes d. consuli, si se offerat occasio.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/><persName>Felix</persName>, qui nihil habet negocii cum tam morosis et pertinacibus, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>qui neque ęquum neque bonum norunt sensusque communis expertes <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>sunt et omnis humanitatis.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Audivi <placeName>Nubergi</placeName> principes confirmasse <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>denuo <placeName ref="l18">Augustanam</placeName> confessionem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Scripseram magistro <persName>Ciconie</persName>, ut <lb xml:id="p1z24"/><persName>Rambouilleto</persName> daret interim decem coronatos, si opus haberet; feram <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>brevi triginta, qui sunt <placeName ref="l167">Geneve</placeName>, etiam si nondum receperim.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Salutabis d. d. et amicos omnes nosque amabis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Te servet dominus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/><placeName ref="l760">Soluduri</placeName> 3. martii.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Recepi <placeName ref="l2448">5 Pagic</placeName> s convenisse, quod <persName>Saraceni</persName> capti in <placeName ref="l285">Lan<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>zbourg</placeName> gravent eos, quod sollicitati ab iis fu<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>erint contra <placeName ref="l646">Glaronenses</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Rursum convenient, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>ut inspiciant super eo, quod de <placeName ref="l646">Glaronensibus</placeName> ab <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>ultima dieta actum est; non quiescent, donec sibi accersant <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>malum.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Tuus ex animo <persName ref="p629">Cognetius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>An herren <persName ref="p495">Heinrichen <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullinger</persName>, verkhünder <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>des worts gottes.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z4"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
